      "role": "user",
      "content": "so i was looking through some of the old coins my uncle left me (he was always a bit eccentric lol) and i noticed something weird. i have this specific set of silver quarters from the late 90s and the way the oxidation is hitting the mint marks... it's not random. like, if you follow the discoloration patterns across the three coins, it almost looks like a sequence of symbols or directions. i feel like he was trying to leave a breadcrumb trail or something. can u help me look at the patterns if i describe them? i need to know if there is actually a logic to the way the tarnish is forming.",
